# Stage
msgid "early_stage"
msgstr "前期"

msgid "late_stage"
msgstr "後期"

msgid "middle_stage"
msgstr "中期"

msgid ""
"Bold and open: Grand words, majestic momentum, informal, expressing feelings"
" directly."
msgstr "豪放曠達：用詞大開大合，氣勢磅礴，不拘小節，直抒胸臆。"

msgid ""
"Buddhist emptiness: Insights of impermanence and emptiness interwoven, light"
" and not mysterious."
msgstr "佛理空相：無常、空相的領悟穿插事中，輕淡不玄。"

msgid ""
"Chronicle style: Like a historian's record, orderly events, few adjectives."
msgstr "編年記事：近史官筆法，記事有序，少形容詞。"

msgid ""
"Cold and concise: Mainly short sentences, every word counts, like metal "
"striking stone, no extra emotional rendering."
msgstr "冷峻簡練：短句為主，字字珠璣，如金石相擊，不做多餘情感渲染。"

# 故事生成文本
msgid "Deal: {winner_name} acquired {item_name} for {price} spirit stones."
msgstr "成交：{winner_name}以{price}靈石拍下{item_name}。"

msgid ""
"Elegant scholarly: Scholarly atmosphere, slight touch of citations, without "
"showing off."
msgstr "雅致書卷：書卷氣、引文氣息淺嘗輒止，不顯擺。"

msgid ""
"Emotion in scenery: Expressing emotion through scenery, blending feelings "
"with the setting."
msgstr "寓情於景：以景見情，情隨境遷，情景交融。"

msgid ""
"Fine line drawing: No decoration, capturing subtle movements and expressions"
" to convey spirit, real and delicate."
msgstr "細筆白描：不加藻飾，通過捕捉極細微的動作與神態來傳神，真實細膩。"

msgid ""
"Folk storytelling: Like a storyteller's tone but in written language, fast-"
"paced, vivid and interesting."
msgstr "民間說書：似說書人口吻但用書面語，敘事節奏明快，生動有趣。"

msgid ""
"Freehand ancient style: Focus on imagery and metaphor, concise, avoiding "
"obscure archaic language."
msgstr "寫意古風：重意象與比興，點到為止，少生僻文言。"

msgid ""
"Gorgeous and bizarre: Heavy sensory description, ornate and seductive "
"language, emphasizing the strangeness of light and color."
msgstr "綺麗詭譎：重感官描寫，辭藻華麗妖冶，強調光影與色彩的奇異感。"

msgid "Item: {item_name}, Description: {description}"
msgstr "物品：{item_name}，介紹：{description}"

msgid ""
"Marketplace life: Grounded writing, using colloquialisms, simple and "
"natural, without pretension."
msgstr "市井煙火：行文接地氣，多用口語化表達，樸實自然，不拿腔拿調。"

msgid ""
"Personification of scenery: Slight personification of scenery, embedding "
"aspirations in the view, not overused."
msgstr "景物擬人：對景施以輕微擬人，景中含志，不濫。"

msgid ""
"Philosophical fable: Asking questions through events, containing one or two "
"punchlines, without preaching."
msgstr "哲思寓言：借事設問，含一兩句畫龍點睛之語，不說教。"

# Story Styles
msgid "story_style.plain_narration"
msgstr "平實敘述：語句克制，少作修飾，如旁觀者據實記錄。"

msgid "story_style.emotion_in_scenery"
msgstr "借景抒情：以景物承載情緒，讓心境自然融入眼前景致。"

msgid "story_style.freehand_ancient"
msgstr "古意寫意：著重意象與比喻，行文凝練，不用艱澀古奧的辭句。"

msgid "story_style.marketplace_life"
msgstr "市井煙火：筆觸貼地，可用口語，質樸自然，不故作姿態。"

msgid "story_style.poetic_lyricism"
msgstr "詩意抒情：多用短句與適度對仗，偶爾用典，不堆砌華麗辭藻。"

msgid "story_style.philosophical_fable"
msgstr "哲思寓言：藉事件提出疑問或點出一兩句醒悟，不作說教。"

msgid "story_style.chronicle"
msgstr "史傳筆法：如史家記事，事件次序分明，少用形容詞。"

msgid "story_style.personified_scenery"
msgstr "景物擬人：輕微賦予景物性情，將志向寄於景中，不可濫用。"

msgid "story_style.taoist_nature"
msgstr "道法自然：點染通俗的道家語彙，不故弄玄虛，收束於一個念頭。"

msgid "story_style.buddhist_emptiness"
msgstr "佛門空寂：輕輕織入無常與空性之感，不寫得神祕晦澀。"

msgid "story_style.folk_storytelling"
